<p>If you live to ~80 years old (about the average in the modernised world):</p>
<p>You’ll have 29,166 days…</p>
<p>700,000 hours…</p>
<p><strong>42,000,000 minutes.</strong></p>
<p>What are you doing with each and ever single one of those minutes?</p>
<p>Each minute on the clock ticking down is a beautiful little microcosm of a life.</p>
<p>Each and every one is a gift, a little chance to change the Universe.</p>
<p>Stop wasting even a single moment.</p>
<p>As always, God bless, and until next time.</p>
